          points: ["Opening balance $31,500 on the credit side", "Additional capital (motor vehicles) $6,000 credited", "Profit for the year $11,850 credited", "Drawings $9,200 debited", "Balance c/d $40,150", "Totals $49,350 and balance b/d $40,150 credit on 1 January 2027"],
