          points: ["Trade discount is for bulk or trade customers; cash discount is for prompt payment", "Trade discount is deducted on the invoice", "Trade discount is not recorded; cash discount is recorded in discount allowed or received", "Trade discount is on list price; cash discount is on the amount owed at payment (or any other valid difference)"],
