              points: ["Opening balances cash $185 and bank $2,310 on the debit side", "Feras: bank $1,470 credit with discount received $30", "Cash sales $630 debit cash", "Nadia: bank $931 debit with discount allowed $19", "Contra 5 Aug: credit cash $500, debit bank $500", "Advertising $75 credit cash; insurance $340 credit bank", "Heba $1,200 debit bank", "Contra 9 Aug: debit cash $300, credit bank $300; Omran cash $97 credit with discount received $3", "Cash balance c/d $443, totals $1,115, balance b/d debit", "Bank balance c/d $2,831, totals $4,941; discount totals 19 and 33"],
